flowchart TD
    A[User acts] --> B{Is the result visible<br/>on screen already?}

    B -->|Yes| C[The state change IS the feedback<br/>≤100 ms · no toast]
    B -->|No| D{Is it async?}

    D -->|No| C
    D -->|Yes| E{Reversible?}

    E -->|Yes| F[Optimistic: apply now,<br/>reconcile behind it]
    E -->|No| G[Pending state ON the control<br/>that was pressed]

    F --> H{Did it succeed?}
    G --> H

    H -->|Success| I{Consequential?<br/>delete · publish · send}
    H -->|Failure| J[Inline AT the cause<br/>+ move focus there<br/>+ role=alert]

    I -->|Yes| K[Toast WITH undo<br/>window ≥5 s]
    I -->|No| L[Success in place<br/>+ aria-live polite]

    F -.rolled back.-> M[Visible correction<br/>+ explanation<br/>NEVER a silent revert]

    C --> N{Long job with<br/>a known size?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Determinate progress<br/>+ aria-busy · announce at end]

    K --> P{Sound axis on?}
    L --> P
    J --> P
    P -->|on| Q[≤300 ms cue<br/>never the only channel]
    P -->|off — the default| R[Silent: visual + announcement<br/>already carry it]
